      "y": 0,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 390,
      "text": "# AI Problem–Solution–Unknown Graph\n\n**总状态栏｜2026-10-04｜STATUS SYNC**\nWindows｜RTX3070 Laptop ACTIVE\n4090 Cloud RETIRED｜4080 32G PENDING_INTEGRATION\n\nSCAN → RECOVER → VERIFY → DISPATCH → WORK → UPDATE\nRecover before Create｜Verify before Expand\n\nC-INTENT：THEORY DONE → EXPERIMENT DESIGN\nC-CONSTRAINT：CYCLE-01 DONE → OFFLINE LABEL\nD-AGENCY：CYCLE-01 DONE → LOG REPLAY\nE-REAL-EVAL：CYCLE-01 DONE → E-H1\nF-LONGRUN：CYCLE-02 DONE → ≥5 REAL RUN EVENTS\n\n论文：PAPER-00 ACTIVE｜3 RQ × 20 P\n每小时收束：Linear → MD → Canvas → Next Action",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -850,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 210,
      "text": "# A｜能力\n\n感知｜理解｜推理｜学习｜生成｜规划｜记忆｜Agent｜多模态｜泛化\n\n**部分研究**",
      "color": "5"
