      "x": 808,
      "y": 262,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "# D｜人机协作\\n\\n**ACTIVE**\\nD-AGENCY｜674-121\\nROUND-1：四因子冻结 DONE\\nROUND-2：自主权分级 DONE\\nL3 AUTO / L2 AUTO+CHECKPOINT / L1 USER_REVIEW / L0 BLOCK\\nNEXT：ROUND-3 反馈沉淀",
