      "x": 499,
      "y": 687,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 280,
      "text": "# E｜评价\n\n**ACTIVE**\nE-REAL-EVAL：CYCLE-01 DONE｜674-122\n冻结 L1 Outcome / L2 Intent+Constraint / L3 Trajectory 三层协议\nNEXT：E-H1 冻结30–50历史case并盲标预测",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "F",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 450,
      "text": "# F｜生产工程\n\n**RESEARCH CONVERGED / IMPLEMENTATION ACTIVE**\nF-LONGRUN：CYCLE-02 DONE\nRUN_LOG_SCHEMA v1.0：ACTIVE\nNEXT：累计 ≥5 条真实跨轮运行事件 → H-F1\nHOST：Windows / RTX3070 ACTIVE\nRTX4080 32G：PENDING_INTEGRATION\n4090 Cloud：RETIRED\nCodex：工作流执行中枢",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
